(1983013, 272766, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very nice. The lines radiating out at the sides are  a distraction for me. I can see you tried hard to blur them out....it''s the sort of thing that makes you wish for beyond basic editing so you could clone them out.</td>', 'Very nice. The lines radiating out at the sides are  a distraction for me. I can see you tried hard to blur them out....it''s the sort of thing that makes you wish for beyond basic editing so you could clone them out.', '2005-12-28 09:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1983020, 272977, 7322, '<td valign="top">I think a tighter crop to eliminate the gravel and the snake''s face and a bit darker in the shadow areas of the scales. Also, much greater depth of field is needed so that the pattern really stands out. The foreground is too soft.</td>', 'I think a tighter crop to eliminate the gravel and the snake''s face and a bit darker in the shadow areas of the scales. Also, much greater depth of field is needed so that the pattern really stands out. The foreground is too soft.', '2005-12-28 09:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
