(1983052, 271810, 7322, '<td valign="top">A good effort ruined  by including the lighter head. It isn''t neccessary for an effect image and it breaks up an otherwise pleasing abstraction of shape and color. The other beef is the whole image needs to be in sharp focus.</td>', 'A good effort ruined  by including the lighter head. It isn''t neccessary for an effect image and it breaks up an otherwise pleasing abstraction of shape and color. The other beef is the whole image needs to be in sharp focus.', '2005-12-28 10:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
