(1983109, 272870, 48298, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition.</td>', 'Beautiful composition.', '2005-12-28 10:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1983110, 272233, 7322, '<td valign="top">Nice simple pattern and texture. I''d like focus on the entire image, however, and the triangle of black at the bottom right corner should be cropped out.</td>', 'Nice simple pattern and texture. I''d like focus on the entire image, however, and the triangle of black at the bottom right corner should be cropped out.', '2005-12-28 10:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1983118, 272980, 18349, '<td valign="top">I like part of this image, but there is another part of which I''m not particularly fond.  I think the pattern aspect would be much stronger without the addition of the oranges and the foreground candles.  The contrasting red/pink background and the row of tealights at an angle is perfect for the pattern, but when you added the foreground elements it broke it up (all my uneducated opinion of course) I think it dissipated the effect.  Without those things, and maybe angled just a tiny bit (2 or 3  degrees) clockwise, I think you''d have a winner.  :)</td>', 'I like part of this image, but there is another part of which I''m not particularly fond.  I think the pattern aspect would be much stronger without the addition of the oranges and the foreground candles.  The contrasting red/pink background and the row of tealights at an angle is perfect for the pattern, but when you added the foreground elements it broke it up (all my uneducated opinion of course) I think it dissipated the effect.  Without those things, and maybe angled just a tiny bit (2 or 3  degrees) clockwise, I think you''d have a winner.  :)', '2005-12-28 10:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1983120, 273252, 19672, '<td valign="top">I like the pattern, a touch washed out to the top right and a bit blotchy here and there. However, I realize this is a basic challenge and I myself could not remove a small blotch from my own.  (6)</td>', 'I like the pattern, a touch washed out to the top right and a bit blotchy here and there. However, I realize this is a basic challenge and I myself could not remove a small blotch from my own.  (6)', '2005-12-28 10:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1983122, 272996, 48360, '<td valign="top">I like the angle of the shot.</td>', 'I like the angle of the shot.', '2005-12-28 10:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1983128, 272876, 48298, '<td valign="top">You''re supposed to throw it on the WALL to see if it''s done!  :)<br/>Fun swirly pattern and nice comp.</td>', 'You''re supposed to throw it on the WALL to see if it''s done!  :)Fun swirly pattern and nice comp.', '2005-12-28 10:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1983131, 273257, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like this quite a bit as a portrait of childhood. However, the ripples don''t really stand out enough for me to suggest pattern. I think a tight crop of the water taken at a side angle to capture the play of light, shadow, and reflection would have revealed more about the patterns that water makes. This photo really is more about the baby.</td>', 'I like this quite a bit as a portrait of childhood. However, the ripples don''t really stand out enough for me to suggest pattern. I think a tight crop of the water taken at a side angle to capture the play of light, shadow, and reflection would have revealed more about the patterns that water makes. This photo really is more about the baby.', '2005-12-28 10:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1983135, 271760, 48298, '<td valign="top">Simple and well executed.</td>', 'Simple and well executed.', '2005-12-28 10:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1983136, 272747, 18349, '<td valign="top">This is very nice...love the B/W and the contrasts.  It''s a bit off center, which kind of distracts.  I might wonder what it looks like cropped in from the top and bottom (and therefore a tiny bit off the sides) to remove the top corners and the black area from the bottom...just a thought.  Great eye and this is a wonderful find nonetheless.  :)</td>', 'This is very nice...love the B/W and the contrasts.  It''s a bit off center, which kind of distracts.  I might wonder what it looks like cropped in from the top and bottom (and therefore a tiny bit off the sides) to remove the top corners and the black area from the bottom...just a thought.  Great eye and this is a wonderful find nonetheless.  :)', '2005-12-28 10:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1983146, 272443, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is another case of too many patterns competing with each other in a single frame. We have the pattern of tree branches, the pattern of the clouds, the pattern of sun rays, and finally the pattern of the utility lines. It''s just too busy to make a strong statement about pattern.</td>', 'This is another case of too many patterns competing with each other in a single frame. We have the pattern of tree branches, the pattern of the clouds, the pattern of sun rays, and finally the pattern of the utility lines. It''s just too busy to make a strong statement about pattern.', '2005-12-28 10:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1983151, 273012, 7322, '<td valign="top">This seems to be more about the birds than pattern. The pattern is just background. A tighter well focused crop isolating a single area of the patterned wall would have made a stronger statement about pattern.</td>', 'This seems to be more about the birds than pattern. The pattern is just background. A tighter well focused crop isolating a single area of the patterned wall would have made a stronger statement about pattern.', '2005-12-28 10:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1983153, 272993, 48298, '<td valign="top">Yum!  Now I''m hungry.  Creative and nice matching frame.</td>', 'Yum!  Now I''m hungry.  Creative and nice matching frame.', '2005-12-28 10:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1983159, 272451, 7322, '<td valign="top">Pretty. I like the color. It is a bit blown out around the edges and I think the background areas should have been cropped out.</td>', 'Pretty. I like the color. It is a bit blown out around the edges and I think the background areas should have been cropped out.', '2005-12-28 10:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1983160, 272972, 48298, '<td valign="top">Interesting and dreamlike.</td>', 'Interesting and dreamlike.', '2005-12-28 10:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1983164, 272244, 48298, '<td valign="top">Nice textures and colors.</td>', 'Nice textures and colors.', '2005-12-28 10:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1983165, 272716, 18349, '<td valign="top">This is a good attempt...the pattern is there, but the angle in which you''ve captured it is a bit flat.  There''s not any kind of dynamic in the image to keep the voter''s eyes moving through the picture.  You also have a bit of a yellowy color cast going on, which will probably deduct points from your score.  Your image is on the small side; always use the entire 640 pixel width/length when you can because people like big images.  I hope I don''t sound too critical or condescending...I just want to help people improve.   Perhaps moving to the right or left, and angling the camera a bit so that we can see some depth in the image...the 3D of the icing and the candies...it would help.  Use your editing program to sharpen up the lines, enhance the colors, and remove the color cast.  PM me if you have any questions or comments about what I''ve said.  Good luck!  :)</td>', 'This is a good attempt...the pattern is there, but the angle in which you''ve captured it is a bit flat.  There''s not any kind of dynamic in the image to keep the voter''s eyes moving through the picture.  You also have a bit of a yellowy color cast going on, which will probably deduct points from your score.  Your image is on the small side; always use the entire 640 pixel width/length when you can because people like big images.  I hope I don''t sound too critical or condescending...I just want to help people improve.   Perhaps moving to the right or left, and angling the camera a bit so that we can see some depth in the image...the 3D of the icing and the candies...it would help.  Use your editing program to sharpen up the lines, enhance the colors, and remove the color cast.  PM me if you have any questions or comments about what I''ve said.  Good luck!  :)', '2005-12-28 10:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1983169, 271814, 7322, '<td valign="top">An interesting idea. I think an infinite depth of field would have been more effective---it would have flattened the  image into a single plane which I think would be create a more striking pattern. The blurry areas aren''t reallly doing much for me.</td>', 'An interesting idea. I think an infinite depth of field would have been more effective---it would have flattened the  image into a single plane which I think would be create a more striking pattern. The blurry areas aren''t reallly doing much for me.', '2005-12-28 10:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
