(1983346, 272967, 48298, '<td valign="top">Darn, it''s too small to really look at the detail.  Looks like it would be pretty.</td>', 'Darn, it''s too small to really look at the detail.  Looks like it would be pretty.', '2005-12-28 11:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
