(1983530, 273129, 47704, '<td valign="top">I tried this and just couldn''t get the shot I wanted.  I actually tried to get up on the platform at the Survivor Tree and take the shot.  The problem is the contrast between that dead grass and the brown in the chairs.  This is a difficult shot in the winter.  I think maybe a night shot would give more contrast.  Good job though.</td>', 'I tried this and just couldn''t get the shot I wanted.  I actually tried to get up on the platform at the Survivor Tree and take the shot.  The problem is the contrast between that dead grass and the brown in the chairs.  This is a difficult shot in the winter.  I think maybe a night shot would give more contrast.  Good job though.', '2005-12-28 11:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1983535, 272233, 47704, '<td valign="top">Great texture.  This is perfect in B&amp;W.  10</td>', 'Great texture.  This is perfect in B&W.  10', '2005-12-28 11:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
