(1984709, 272537, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very nice.  Criticism; not much, perhaps a crop variation or ''bigger width'' may have made this even better, not sure.  Toning works well.  Good fit for the Challenge.</td>', '8 - Very nice.  Criticism; not much, perhaps a crop variation or ''bigger width'' may have made this even better, not sure.  Toning works well.  Good fit for the Challenge.', '2005-12-28 22:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
