(1984798, 272759, 40019, '<td valign="top">Wonderful macro!  Great colors and texture!  Water drops are a great touch.  I hope this one does well - high score from me.</td>', 'Wonderful macro!  Great colors and texture!  Water drops are a great touch.  I hope this one does well - high score from me.', '2005-12-28 23:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
