(1984880, 272526, 40019, '<td valign="top">Very cool, just had some of this in my salad tonight.  :-)  The focus seems a little off, could have been crisper (not the cabbage, the focus!).   I wonder what this would have looked like with some light shining through the cabbage?  Nice picture - great idea!</td>', 'Very cool, just had some of this in my salad tonight.  :-)  The focus seems a little off, could have been crisper (not the cabbage, the focus!).   I wonder what this would have looked like with some light shining through the cabbage?  Nice picture - great idea!', '2005-12-28 23:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
