(1984921, 273117, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very nice.  Good color and texture capture.  Difficult, but perhaps slight sharper either overall or on the ''two in the center'' and a nudge rotation/crop variation to gain more balance/symmetry, may have made this even better in my opinion.  Seems a ''reflection issue'' top left, but minor.</td>', '8 - Very nice.  Good color and texture capture.  Difficult, but perhaps slight sharper either overall or on the ''two in the center'' and a nudge rotation/crop variation to gain more balance/symmetry, may have made this even better in my opinion.  Seems a ''reflection issue'' top left, but minor.', '2005-12-28 23:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1984925, 273223, 40019, '<td valign="top">Very cool!  Nicely done - great textures.</td>', 'Very cool!  Nicely done - great textures.', '2005-12-28 23:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1984928, 271792, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Very nice.  Good colors.  Obviously you''ve gone for this specific crop/framing, and it ''works'' in my opinion, but I still wonder whether a slightly tighter crop to the center vein, or else of course the ''whole leaf'', may have given this more impact, especially for this Challenge.  Possibly even just ''as is'' but with a fraction more ''empty space'' on the left, depending what is there, of course.</td>', '7 - Very nice.  Good colors.  Obviously you''ve gone for this specific crop/framing, and it ''works'' in my opinion, but I still wonder whether a slightly tighter crop to the center vein, or else of course the ''whole leaf'', may have given this more impact, especially for this Challenge.  Possibly even just ''as is'' but with a fraction more ''empty space'' on the left, depending what is there, of course.', '2005-12-28 23:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1984932, 272537, 48876, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2005-12-28 23:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1984934, 272651, 40019, '<td valign="top">Very cool image!  I hope this one does well!  Only "slight" criticism is that I would have liked it to be a little crisper.  Although definitely no points lost for that.  Nicely done!  Great entry for this challenge.</td>', 'Very cool image!  I hope this one does well!  Only "slight" criticism is that I would have liked it to be a little crisper.  Although definitely no points lost for that.  Nicely done!  Great entry for this challenge.', '2005-12-28 23:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1984938, 272731, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good.  Good perspective.  Sharper focus on the ''in focus'' areas and, depending on angle, trying to either eliminate or ''use'' that palm(?) more, may have made this better in my opinion.  Looks like the quality has started to degrade here, which may be a result of zoom/cropping too tightly, who knows.  Perhaps a variation in cropping or a nudge rotation trying to gain more overall ''balance'' as well.</td>', '6 - Good.  Good perspective.  Sharper focus on the ''in focus'' areas and, depending on angle, trying to either eliminate or ''use'' that palm(?) more, may have made this better in my opinion.  Looks like the quality has started to degrade here, which may be a result of zoom/cropping too tightly, who knows.  Perhaps a variation in cropping or a nudge rotation trying to gain more overall ''balance'' as well.', '2005-12-28 23:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1984946, 272775, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice cropping/symmetry/composition.   Criticism; could be a result of too tight a crop/zoom, but the quality seems to have degraded here, and is one of the first things that I noticed (or could just be blur/focal issues),  so perhaps more zoom out (depending what you had to work with) to try to achieve that ''quality'', may have made this better in my opinion.  May also be the result of post processing too, who knows.</td>', '6 - Nice cropping/symmetry/composition.   Criticism; could be a result of too tight a crop/zoom, but the quality seems to have degraded here, and is one of the first things that I noticed (or could just be blur/focal issues),  so perhaps more zoom out (depending what you had to work with) to try to achieve that ''quality'', may have made this better in my opinion.  May also be the result of post processing too, who knows.', '2005-12-28 23:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1984952, 273217, 44172, '<td valign="top">I really like this image, so simple yet elegant, like the hint of blue in the corners, great focus, very nice work :)</td>', 'I really like this image, so simple yet elegant, like the hint of blue in the corners, great focus, very nice work :)', '2005-12-28 23:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1984958, 271839, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Good potential.  Criticism; depending on quality and what you had to work with, a really tight crop on this, eliminating the keeper''s hand (even if that means ''cutting'' the tail/feet/talons/etc), especially for this Challenge, would have likely made this much better in my opinion.  Likely still be ''blurred'', but still would enhance the pattern more. edit:typo<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-01-05 22:55:04.</i></td>', '5 - Good potential.  Criticism; depending on quality and what you had to work with, a really tight crop on this, eliminating the keeper''s hand (even if that means ''cutting'' the tail/feet/talons/etc), especially for this Challenge, would have likely made this much better in my opinion.  Likely still be ''blurred'', but still would enhance the pattern more. edit:typo', '2005-12-28 23:54:36.000000', '2006-01-05 22:55:04.000000', 1),
