(1985562, 272149, 2022, '<td valign="top">OK, I think that the picture is supposed to show the pattern of the spider''s web, a great take on the challenge. However, I think that the effect this picture could have is lost by the photographer not having got close enough to the subject, too many extraneous elements that do not add anything to the picture. (6)</td>', 'OK, I think that the picture is supposed to show the pattern of the spider''s web, a great take on the challenge. However, I think that the effect this picture could have is lost by the photographer not having got close enough to the subject, too many extraneous elements that do not add anything to the picture. (6)', '2005-12-29 05:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1985565, 272065, 2022, '<td valign="top">I am not sure what I am supposed to focus on here and what the link to the challenge is...framing is problematic and the ugly flash reflection just does not help...try using higher ISO setting to avoid having to use the flash (4)</td>', 'I am not sure what I am supposed to focus on here and what the link to the challenge is...framing is problematic and the ugly flash reflection just does not help...try using higher ISO setting to avoid having to use the flash (4)', '2005-12-29 05:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1985566, 271881, 2022, '<td valign="top">Somehow I think this picture was submitted to the wrong challenge...hard to see what the link to Pattern challenge is (3)</td>', 'Somehow I think this picture was submitted to the wrong challenge...hard to see what the link to Pattern challenge is (3)', '2005-12-29 05:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1985567, 273023, 48228, '<td valign="top">Great neon pastle colors, great texture  as well, good composition.........................</td>', 'Great neon pastle colors, great texture  as well, good composition.........................', '2005-12-29 05:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
