(1985585, 273194, 2022, '<td valign="top">This is a great picture, one of my favourites in this challenge. I like the pattern of the curvy lines and the way the single, off-center leaf complements the composition (10)</td>', 'This is a great picture, one of my favourites in this challenge. I like the pattern of the curvy lines and the way the single, off-center leaf complements the composition (10)', '2005-12-29 05:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
