(1986544, 272315, 44172, '<td valign="top">excellent capture - I like the crop or layout - balloon in lower corner is great way to go and the lines in the sky seem to jet right out of the balloon for you - nice work :)</td>', 'excellent capture - I like the crop or layout - balloon in lower corner is great way to go and the lines in the sky seem to jet right out of the balloon for you - nice work :)', '2005-12-29 15:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
