(1986714, 273111, 47096, '<td valign="top">I like the leading lines and textures in this photo, but  it would be interesting to see this taken from a perspective closer to the rails. If the lens was lower, I think the focus would have been more on the parts of the track that form the pattern, and less on the background, which is a bit distracting.</td>', 'I like the leading lines and textures in this photo, but  it would be interesting to see this taken from a perspective closer to the rails. If the lens was lower, I think the focus would have been more on the parts of the track that form the pattern, and less on the background, which is a bit distracting.', '2005-12-29 16:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1986716, 272532, 47096, '<td valign="top">Probably the best of those type of shots.</td>', 'Probably the best of those type of shots.', '2005-12-29 16:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
