(1986817, 273214, 21362, '<td valign="top">I think I would''ve used a square crop, as well as given this a border. I think that would have even driven the square theme further.<br/> <br/>Something seems not *quite* right with the exposure. But I like it. Nice entry and well done.</td>', 'I think I would''ve used a square crop, as well as given this a border. I think that would have even driven the square theme further. Something seems not *quite* right with the exposure. But I like it. Nice entry and well done.', '2005-12-29 17:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1986822, 271812, 21362, '<td valign="top">This is very simple and I love it. The dusting of snow really made the shot. Nice exposure, it has an almost dirty feel to it the way the cold damp pavement looks. <br/> <br/>Well done.</td>', 'This is very simple and I love it. The dusting of snow really made the shot. Nice exposure, it has an almost dirty feel to it the way the cold damp pavement looks.  Well done.', '2005-12-29 18:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
