(1986902, 273214, 30881, '<td valign="top">WoW ! What a find. I had to come back and re-study this. Really like the bright glare in a few spots and the darker shadows in others. Because of the unique imaginative find and the modernistic feel this has I say "10"</td>', 'WoW ! What a find. I had to come back and re-study this. Really like the bright glare in a few spots and the darker shadows in others. Because of the unique imaginative find and the modernistic feel this has I say "10"', '2005-12-29 18:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
