(1987355, 273098, 40019, '<td valign="top">Neat idea.  Definitely shows a pattern!  Few things I would have done differently - 1) fix the white balance, picture is too dark and gray, 2) crop in a little more to better emphasis the pattern, 3) sharpen it up a bit - texture contrast of the snow and pattern would have been cool.  Good try!</td>', 'Neat idea.  Definitely shows a pattern!  Few things I would have done differently - 1) fix the white balance, picture is too dark and gray, 2) crop in a little more to better emphasis the pattern, 3) sharpen it up a bit - texture contrast of the snow and pattern would have been cool.  Good try!', '2005-12-29 22:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
