(1988334, 272193, 7322, '<td valign="top">This looks rather like a nice snapshot to me. I don''t really get a sense of pattern from it. If you were attracted to the pattern of the goose''s feathers than a tighter crop to isolate a single area of the goose is necessary to make a statement about that. I''m not sure if that is what you were aiming at because it really isn''t clear in this shot----I''m just making an educated guess. <br/> <br/></td>', 'This looks rather like a nice snapshot to me. I don''t really get a sense of pattern from it. If you were attracted to the pattern of the goose''s feathers than a tighter crop to isolate a single area of the goose is necessary to make a statement about that. I''m not sure if that is what you were aiming at because it really isn''t clear in this shot----I''m just making an educated guess.  ', '2005-12-30 11:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1988335, 273071, 39158, '<td valign="top">great capture</td>', 'great capture', '2005-12-30 11:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1988336, 273217, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like that you shot from a less obvious point of view to really isolate the pattern that attracted you. Great effort.</td>', 'I like that you shot from a less obvious point of view to really isolate the pattern that attracted you. Great effort.', '2005-12-30 11:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1988337, 273185, 39158, '<td valign="top">nice capture</td>', 'nice capture', '2005-12-30 11:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1988341, 272470, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a nice subject and you''ve isolated the pattern quite effectively. The details are nearly blown out, sadly. There needs to be more tonal contrast for the pattern to have maximum impact.</td>', 'This is a nice subject and you''ve isolated the pattern quite effectively. The details are nearly blown out, sadly. There needs to be more tonal contrast for the pattern to have maximum impact.', '2005-12-30 11:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1988344, 272870, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like that you isolated the subject very effectively from the background. I just wish you had pulled in a lot closer. This little leaf surrounded by so much empty space doesn''t quite make a bold enough statement for me.</td>', 'I like that you isolated the subject very effectively from the background. I just wish you had pulled in a lot closer. This little leaf surrounded by so much empty space doesn''t quite make a bold enough statement for me.', '2005-12-30 11:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1988348, 272853, 7322, '<td valign="top">Good idea and nice composition but your focus is too soft.</td>', 'Good idea and nice composition but your focus is too soft.', '2005-12-30 11:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1988350, 271835, 7322, '<td valign="top">Good subject and effective cropping to isolate a single area of pattern.</td>', 'Good subject and effective cropping to isolate a single area of pattern.', '2005-12-30 11:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1988352, 273251, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like the subject and the focus seems sharp. I kind of wish the crop wasn''t so tall and narrow. It feels a bit cramped to me.</td>', 'I like the subject and the focus seems sharp. I kind of wish the crop wasn''t so tall and narrow. It feels a bit cramped to me.', '2005-12-30 11:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1988356, 272975, 7322, '<td valign="top">For me, this needs to be entirely in focus to make a graphic impact. The blurred areas don''t make enough of a statement yet they occupy the majority of the frame. On the plus side, you effectively isolated a single area of pattern, which to my mind is how to make a good photographic statement about pattern.</td>', 'For me, this needs to be entirely in focus to make a graphic impact. The blurred areas don''t make enough of a statement yet they occupy the majority of the frame. On the plus side, you effectively isolated a single area of pattern, which to my mind is how to make a good photographic statement about pattern.', '2005-12-30 11:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1988361, 273190, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a rather overexposed. I like the subject of the leaves. My suggestion is that a single leaf needs to fill the frame, rather than the whole plant, to really show off the pattern on the leaves. If the intent was to show the pattern the leaves make together than an more overhead angle of view is needed along with a much tighter crop to eliminate any other details (like the mulch and the wall, etc),</td>', 'This is a rather overexposed. I like the subject of the leaves. My suggestion is that a single leaf needs to fill the frame, rather than the whole plant, to really show off the pattern on the leaves. If the intent was to show the pattern the leaves make together than an more overhead angle of view is needed along with a much tighter crop to eliminate any other details (like the mulch and the wall, etc),', '2005-12-30 11:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1988364, 272131, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty dull subject. I think what may have initially attracted you was the windows and the pattern they make. My suggestion is that a tighter crop of that area, in order to isolate the not-so-interesting stuff (like the modern concrete blocks and the lettering) would make a more interesting photograph.</td>', 'This is a pretty dull subject. I think what may have initially attracted you was the windows and the pattern they make. My suggestion is that a tighter crop of that area, in order to isolate the not-so-interesting stuff (like the modern concrete blocks and the lettering) would make a more interesting photograph.', '2005-12-30 11:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1988365, 273143, 7322, '<td valign="top">A good idea. I wish you had shown it much bigger. You''ve wasted a lot of your pixel allotment on the ugly black border.</td>', 'A good idea. I wish you had shown it much bigger. You''ve wasted a lot of your pixel allotment on the ugly black border.', '2005-12-30 12:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1988367, 273163, 7322, '<td valign="top">Good subject and nice isolation of pattern from distracting background. My beefs are it is a bit overexposed and the cropping is too tall and narrow.</td>', 'Good subject and nice isolation of pattern from distracting background. My beefs are it is a bit overexposed and the cropping is too tall and narrow.', '2005-12-30 12:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1988372, 273117, 7322, '<td valign="top">Nice abstractions and texture. I wish there was more detail in shadow areas and I don''t care for the glare on the upper left area of the frame. Also, it needs a bit more color saturation.</td>', 'Nice abstractions and texture. I wish there was more detail in shadow areas and I don''t care for the glare on the upper left area of the frame. Also, it needs a bit more color saturation.', '2005-12-30 12:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1988374, 272747, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like the contrasty black and white. This is a nice crop, effectively isolating the pattern from any distracting elements. It''s also a great subject. One of my favorites so far.</td>', 'I like the contrasty black and white. This is a nice crop, effectively isolating the pattern from any distracting elements. It''s also a great subject. One of my favorites so far.', '2005-12-30 12:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1988376, 271768, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a crative and interesting effort. It doesn''t quite gel for me and the reason is the drab brown building just isn''t an attractive backdrop for the white snow flakes. I would have liked this better if the background had been deep black or something colorful.</td>', 'This is a crative and interesting effort. It doesn''t quite gel for me and the reason is the drab brown building just isn''t an attractive backdrop for the white snow flakes. I would have liked this better if the background had been deep black or something colorful.', '2005-12-30 12:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1988381, 273022, 7322, '<td valign="top">Is this sepia tone? There is a yellowish cast that I don''t like for this subject. This is a good choice for pattern (I tried a few shots with a colander myself but ultimately discarded them :D). I don''t know if this shot says much to me about pattern. I think a tighter crop of just the mashing part would be more effective.</td>', 'Is this sepia tone? There is a yellowish cast that I don''t like for this subject. This is a good choice for pattern (I tried a few shots with a colander myself but ultimately discarded them :D). I don''t know if this shot says much to me about pattern. I think a tighter crop of just the mashing part would be more effective.', '2005-12-30 12:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1988385, 272059, 7322, '<td valign="top">An original choice of subject and I love the vintage patterns (I collect them myself). Unfortunately, this is way too shadowy to be really effective.</td>', 'An original choice of subject and I love the vintage patterns (I collect them myself). Unfortunately, this is way too shadowy to be really effective.', '2005-12-30 12:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1988388, 273253, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is eyecatching. I''m wondering if it wouldn''t have been more effective without the crane. To me, the crane adds a confusing element to an otherwise harmonious pattern of converging lines.</td>', 'This is eyecatching. I''m wondering if it wouldn''t have been more effective without the crane. To me, the crane adds a confusing element to an otherwise harmonious pattern of converging lines.', '2005-12-30 12:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
