(1989159, 273137, 34217, '<td valign="top">great shot, but this concept has been done so so so many times.  I would love to see some of your own creativity rather than someone elses.  I am hoping that this does not place (not cause it is not great) because I am longing to see something new and exciting.  I do think that it will place well.  On the flip side, next time you do something with water drops use glycerin, your drops will be perfect!</td>', 'great shot, but this concept has been done so so so many times.  I would love to see some of your own creativity rather than someone elses.  I am hoping that this does not place (not cause it is not great) because I am longing to see something new and exciting.  I do think that it will place well.  On the flip side, next time you do something with water drops use glycerin, your drops will be perfect!', '2005-12-30 20:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1989163, 273035, 34217, '<td valign="top">I wish you had gotten in closer or cropped is long and thin.  I think it would have been more exciting</td>', 'I wish you had gotten in closer or cropped is long and thin.  I think it would have been more exciting', '2005-12-30 20:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1989165, 273222, 34217, '<td valign="top">photographing food is ver very hard.  You did an ok job, but your photo does not make me want to eat these cookies and that should be the goal of most food photos.  good try and a difficult subject.  On a more positive note, you did a good job of "posing" your cookies and I love the crop</td>', 'photographing food is ver very hard.  You did an ok job, but your photo does not make me want to eat these cookies and that should be the goal of most food photos.  good try and a difficult subject.  On a more positive note, you did a good job of "posing" your cookies and I love the crop', '2005-12-30 20:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1989166, 272251, 34217, '<td valign="top">love it!</td>', 'love it!', '2005-12-30 20:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
