(1991039, 271893, 14614, '<td valign="top">size is the only thing that''s holding me back from giving this one a higher score -- I can''t see the details (did you allow for the full 640 on one side?)  the colors are unique and the water drops add some interest</td>', 'size is the only thing that''s holding me back from giving this one a higher score -- I can''t see the details (did you allow for the full 640 on one side?)  the colors are unique and the water drops add some interest', '2005-12-31 18:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1991118, 272996, 50373, '<td valign="top">Very, very, very nice!</td>', 'Very, very, very nice!', '2005-12-31 19:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1991465, 271881, 48546, '<td valign="top">wrong challenge<br/>that said, If this is for Oops, I don''t get it. Where''s the oops? <br/>Focus seems soft. Good color though.</td>', 'wrong challengethat said, If this is for Oops, I don''t get it. Where''s the oops? Focus seems soft. Good color though.', '2005-12-31 22:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1991716, 272717, 27767, '<td valign="top">Good pattern, though without a specific focal point my eyes feel a little unguided and lost</td>', 'Good pattern, though without a specific focal point my eyes feel a little unguided and lost', '2006-01-01 00:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1991717, 272126, 27767, '<td valign="top">I like this great closeup perspective. My only suggestion would be to sharpen the photo up a little to really bring out the details</td>', 'I like this great closeup perspective. My only suggestion would be to sharpen the photo up a little to really bring out the details', '2006-01-01 00:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1991722, 272789, 27767, '<td valign="top">This definitely meets the challenge, though it doesn''t hold my interest for very long.  Maybe an additional prop within the basket could add some interest.</td>', 'This definitely meets the challenge, though it doesn''t hold my interest for very long.  Maybe an additional prop within the basket could add some interest.', '2006-01-01 00:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1991726, 273069, 27767, '<td valign="top">Good focus and color in this shot. I think this would look a little better without the shadow along the bottom.</td>', 'Good focus and color in this shot. I think this would look a little better without the shadow along the bottom.', '2006-01-01 00:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1991728, 273137, 27767, '<td valign="top">Great concept for this shot :)  I really like the feeling of structure provided by the grid, and the random positions and shapes of the droplets. Good job.</td>', 'Great concept for this shot :)  I really like the feeling of structure provided by the grid, and the random positions and shapes of the droplets. Good job.', '2006-01-01 00:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1991734, 272688, 27767, '<td valign="top">Great idea and subject, though I think that this shot could be improved by getting up close and personal with the cactus. The background is a little distracting and it adds nothing to the shot. A more unique perspective could bring a lot of interest to this shot too. I''d love to see a macro shot focused just on a few rows of spines to *really* emphasize the patterns here.</td>', 'Great idea and subject, though I think that this shot could be improved by getting up close and personal with the cactus. The background is a little distracting and it adds nothing to the shot. A more unique perspective could bring a lot of interest to this shot too. I''d love to see a macro shot focused just on a few rows of spines to *really* emphasize the patterns here.', '2006-01-01 00:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1991735, 273124, 27767, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge well. Maybe a little sharpening could bring out some interesting details in the rock. I''d also be interested to see a closer shot with some rock patterns and maybe a branch or moss pattern too.</td>', 'Meets the challenge well. Maybe a little sharpening could bring out some interesting details in the rock. I''d also be interested to see a closer shot with some rock patterns and maybe a branch or moss pattern too.', '2006-01-01 00:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1991736, 273133, 27767, '<td valign="top">I definitely like this shot in black and white. Good focus and concept.</td>', 'I definitely like this shot in black and white. Good focus and concept.', '2006-01-01 00:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1991737, 272996, 27767, '<td valign="top">Great pattern, and I like the abstract feel it has.  I think this shot would look a little better desaturated, as the color doesn''t add anything.</td>', 'Great pattern, and I like the abstract feel it has.  I think this shot would look a little better desaturated, as the color doesn''t add anything.', '2006-01-01 00:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1991739, 272984, 27767, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and great focus, though I''m having a little trouble identifying a repeating pattern in this image.</td>', 'Nice colors and great focus, though I''m having a little trouble identifying a repeating pattern in this image.', '2006-01-01 00:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1991744, 271779, 27767, '<td valign="top">Good pattern and sharp focus throughout the image. I would like this shot brightened up a little so that it has a very lively, bright, happy feel; whereas now it looks a little grey and dull.</td>', 'Good pattern and sharp focus throughout the image. I would like this shot brightened up a little so that it has a very lively, bright, happy feel; whereas now it looks a little grey and dull.', '2006-01-01 00:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1991747, 273223, 27767, '<td valign="top">Great concept for this shot, and meets challenge. The shot is overall pretty busy. I wonder if this same idea could be done with a tighter crop, and focusing on a smaller section of the pattern to bring more emphasis to it.</td>', 'Great concept for this shot, and meets challenge. The shot is overall pretty busy. I wonder if this same idea could be done with a tighter crop, and focusing on a smaller section of the pattern to bring more emphasis to it.', '2006-01-01 00:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1991750, 272771, 27767, '<td valign="top">I like the abstract feel to this shot and the color. My eyes feel like they are lost and wandering though without a more defined focal point.</td>', 'I like the abstract feel to this shot and the color. My eyes feel like they are lost and wandering though without a more defined focal point.', '2006-01-01 00:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1991754, 271812, 27767, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot :) Great inclusion of several patterns, and they fit together so nicely.  I like the dominant blues in this shot. Good focus and perspective.</td>', 'I like this shot a lot :) Great inclusion of several patterns, and they fit together so nicely.  I like the dominant blues in this shot. Good focus and perspective.', '2006-01-01 00:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1991759, 272983, 27767, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting in this shot! Very nice background and focus. I definitely like the splash of green to the left, though it feels slightly awkward hanging half in and half out of the shot.</td>', 'I really like the lighting in this shot! Very nice background and focus. I definitely like the splash of green to the left, though it feels slightly awkward hanging half in and half out of the shot.', '2006-01-01 01:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1991763, 273216, 27767, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge for sure, but I don''t personally like the apparent motion blur.</td>', 'Fits the challenge for sure, but I don''t personally like the apparent motion blur.', '2006-01-01 01:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1991768, 272532, 27767, '<td valign="top">Very interesting pattern here. I''ll be interested to read about how you did this. I think this shot could benefit from some cropping of the empty spaces at the bottom and top of the image.</td>', 'Very interesting pattern here. I''ll be interested to read about how you did this. I think this shot could benefit from some cropping of the empty spaces at the bottom and top of the image.', '2006-01-01 01:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1991778, 273159, 27767, '<td valign="top">I think this looks good in black and white. I find the primary subject and the focus to be at odds here. The primary subject, referenced by the title, is not in sharp focus, but the background is. The background certainly helps provide reasoning for the railing, though I wish the railing was in sharper focus than the backround.</td>', 'I think this looks good in black and white. I find the primary subject and the focus to be at odds here. The primary subject, referenced by the title, is not in sharp focus, but the background is. The background certainly helps provide reasoning for the railing, though I wish the railing was in sharper focus than the backround.', '2006-01-01 01:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1991781, 272792, 27767, '<td valign="top">Very nice pattern and interesting lighting. As I''m sure most others are saying, I too wish this shot was larger, up near the 640 pixel limit.</td>', 'Very nice pattern and interesting lighting. As I''m sure most others are saying, I too wish this shot was larger, up near the 640 pixel limit.', '2006-01-01 01:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1991782, 272786, 27767, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject and lines here.  The lighting in the middle looks quite blown out to me, and the focus isn''t very sharp.  I''d love to see this exact same shot in sharp focus and exposed without any blown out highlights.</td>', 'Interesting subject and lines here.  The lighting in the middle looks quite blown out to me, and the focus isn''t very sharp.  I''d love to see this exact same shot in sharp focus and exposed without any blown out highlights.', '2006-01-01 01:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1991785, 272381, 27767, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, and I think it fits the challenge. I like the composition and lighting, though the shadow line crossing the right side of the background is a little distracting.</td>', 'Interesting idea, and I think it fits the challenge. I like the composition and lighting, though the shadow line crossing the right side of the background is a little distracting.', '2006-01-01 01:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1991789, 272975, 27767, '<td valign="top">I like this shallow depth of field.  I like the diagonal lines as well. This shot could maybe use something to provide a focal point though for a little added interest.</td>', 'I like this shallow depth of field.  I like the diagonal lines as well. This shot could maybe use something to provide a focal point though for a little added interest.', '2006-01-01 01:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1991793, 272977, 27767, '<td valign="top">Excellent focus on the scales. It really shows their texture. Not that I''d want to reach out and touch them though. The little twig infront of the snake''s head is a little distracting, but not much one can do about that in the Basic editing rules :-\</td>', 'Excellent focus on the scales. It really shows their texture. Not that I''d want to reach out and touch them though. The little twig infront of the snake''s head is a little distracting, but not much one can do about that in the Basic editing rules :-\', '2006-01-01 01:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1991795, 273254, 27767, '<td valign="top">Excellent patterns here. I love the long shadows from this lighting. I also like the tilt of the shot, as it keeps it from feeling static</td>', 'Excellent patterns here. I love the long shadows from this lighting. I also like the tilt of the shot, as it keeps it from feeling static', '2006-01-01 01:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
