(1996502, 273148, 8891, '<td valign="top">looks like you did some desat on this and in so doing may have lost the detail of what the dark area is...I like the desat and I like this as an abstract, but if you had any green in the trees, it might have been better.</td>', 'looks like you did some desat on this and in so doing may have lost the detail of what the dark area is...I like the desat and I like this as an abstract, but if you had any green in the trees, it might have been better.', '2006-01-02 21:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
