(1996622, 271936, 48667, '<td valign="top">Great shot, excellent focus on detail...really like the DOF.</td>', 'Great shot, excellent focus on detail...really like the DOF.', '2006-01-02 21:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1996634, 273153, 30364, '<td valign="top">Why''s it agricultural?  It looks more like a rural road bridge.  Nevertheless, it''s an interesting image of an "accidental" pattern, and one that would not be as effective seen from any other angle or position.  And that''s the interpretation of the challenge I prefer - finding unexpected patterns hidden in everyday objects.  7.</td>', 'Why''s it agricultural?  It looks more like a rural road bridge.  Nevertheless, it''s an interesting image of an "accidental" pattern, and one that would not be as effective seen from any other angle or position.  And that''s the interpretation of the challenge I prefer - finding unexpected patterns hidden in everyday objects.  7.', '2006-01-02 21:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1996646, 272059, 8891, '<td valign="top">I am only guessing...so if this wasn''t the one, don''t shoot me...but if it is, I just gotta say it. "And the pattern is?" LOL....ok I get it! Do not hurt me.  Great take on the challenge and very well put together. I wish the lighting was a bit more consistent but I do like the idea very much! Very imaginative.</td>', 'I am only guessing...so if this wasn''t the one, don''t shoot me...but if it is, I just gotta say it. "And the pattern is?" LOL....ok I get it! Do not hurt me.  Great take on the challenge and very well put together. I wish the lighting was a bit more consistent but I do like the idea very much! Very imaginative.', '2006-01-02 21:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1996656, 273137, 34171, '<td valign="top">That is cool.</td>', 'That is cool.', '2006-01-02 21:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1996743, 273137, 18644, '<td valign="top">A very good picture, losing points for an effect that is overdone here on DPC. a lack of originality. 6</td>', 'A very good picture, losing points for an effect that is overdone here on DPC. a lack of originality. 6', '2006-01-02 22:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1996752, 272824, 32084, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.</td>', 'Nicely done.', '2006-01-02 22:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1996757, 273112, 10818, '<td valign="top">Oh, so nice.<br/> <br/>Love the perspective and rich colors.</td>', 'Oh, so nice. Love the perspective and rich colors.', '2006-01-02 22:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1996761, 273142, 32084, '<td valign="top">Nicely done - great lighting and detail.</td>', 'Nicely done - great lighting and detail.', '2006-01-02 22:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1996763, 272892, 48546, '<td valign="top">Not sure what paper this is but the way you arranged it caused a very clever pattern.  I like how your lighting emphasises the patten.  Great job!</td>', 'Not sure what paper this is but the way you arranged it caused a very clever pattern.  I like how your lighting emphasises the patten.  Great job!', '2006-01-02 22:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1996766, 272644, 10818, '<td valign="top">Its sorta hard to see the focal point, nice pattern though.</td>', 'Its sorta hard to see the focal point, nice pattern though.', '2006-01-02 22:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1996777, 272983, 48546, '<td valign="top">Even though the detail seems to be blown out on right side of the flower, my eye is drawn to the center of the flower and then back around to the left where the second stem is placed.  Good job!</td>', 'Even though the detail seems to be blown out on right side of the flower, my eye is drawn to the center of the flower and then back around to the left where the second stem is placed.  Good job!', '2006-01-02 22:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1996796, 273117, 48546, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this image, how you''ve place the pattern in a diagonal position and how you''ve arranged the colors to compliment each other. I''m not sure that I personally like the purple hue but it still works.  Good job and good idea!</td>', 'I like the composition of this image, how you''ve place the pattern in a diagonal position and how you''ve arranged the colors to compliment each other. I''m not sure that I personally like the purple hue but it still works.  Good job and good idea!', '2006-01-02 22:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1996812, 273253, 48546, '<td valign="top">This is definately and interesting image, very eye catching and well composed.  The only thing is, if the paper figure is your subject, then the green light seems to fight for attention.</td>', 'This is definately and interesting image, very eye catching and well composed.  The only thing is, if the paper figure is your subject, then the green light seems to fight for attention.', '2006-01-02 22:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1996842, 273194, 48546, '<td valign="top">Adding the leaf added a nice point of interest, I don''t think the image would have been as impactful without it. Good job!</td>', 'Adding the leaf added a nice point of interest, I don''t think the image would have been as impactful without it. Good job!', '2006-01-02 22:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1996851, 271893, 14805, '<td valign="top">why so small?</td>', 'why so small?', '2006-01-02 22:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1996854, 272974, 14805, '<td valign="top">great focus point</td>', 'great focus point', '2006-01-02 22:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1996856, 273244, 14805, '<td valign="top">cool. but what is it?</td>', 'cool. but what is it?', '2006-01-02 22:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1996858, 272324, 14805, '<td valign="top">fucus? he doesn''t even know us?</td>', 'fucus? he doesn''t even know us?', '2006-01-02 22:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1996859, 273194, 14805, '<td valign="top">very nice. my favorite so far</td>', 'very nice. my favorite so far', '2006-01-02 22:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1996861, 271801, 14805, '<td valign="top">tighter shot would have brought out the patterns</td>', 'tighter shot would have brought out the patterns', '2006-01-02 22:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1996867, 273216, 14805, '<td valign="top">I''m drunk. You know what? the longer I stare at this, the better it seems. I see motion in here, I mean the picture actually seems to be moving here. I am going to give it a 10. way to go.</td>', 'I''m drunk. You know what? the longer I stare at this, the better it seems. I see motion in here, I mean the picture actually seems to be moving here. I am going to give it a 10. way to go.', '2006-01-02 22:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1996872, 273140, 14805, '<td valign="top">awesome!</td>', 'awesome!', '2006-01-02 22:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1996885, 271936, 48546, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective on this image and a great idea for a pattern.  I think the overall image may have been better if the pattern had covered either more or less of the image.  As it is, the dividing point is close to the center of the image.  Also, blocking the light to darken the face may have helped to make the pattern stand out a little more.</td>', 'Interesting perspective on this image and a great idea for a pattern.  I think the overall image may have been better if the pattern had covered either more or less of the image.  As it is, the dividing point is close to the center of the image.  Also, blocking the light to darken the face may have helped to make the pattern stand out a little more.', '2006-01-02 22:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1996902, 273008, 48546, '<td valign="top">Nice find for a pattern.  In the overall image, the black object on the left side of the image is a bit distracting however the colors are nicely saturated.</td>', 'Nice find for a pattern.  In the overall image, the black object on the left side of the image is a bit distracting however the colors are nicely saturated.', '2006-01-02 22:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1996908, 272785, 48546, '<td valign="top">I like this overall image but think it may have been even better with more depth of field making all the pavers sharp. Nice lighting.</td>', 'I like this overall image but think it may have been even better with more depth of field making all the pavers sharp. Nice lighting.', '2006-01-02 23:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1996911, 272192, 48546, '<td valign="top">VERY imaginative! You''ve done a great job showing the texture of this mushroom with your lighting. I like also how you''ve diagonally positioned the mushroom and directed the light so it looks like the sun IS the source of light.</td>', 'VERY imaginative! You''ve done a great job showing the texture of this mushroom with your lighting. I like also how you''ve diagonally positioned the mushroom and directed the light so it looks like the sun IS the source of light.', '2006-01-02 23:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1996917, 273053, 48546, '<td valign="top">I really like this image, it''s very dynamic and I even like how the feet are similar.</td>', 'I really like this image, it''s very dynamic and I even like how the feet are similar.', '2006-01-02 23:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1996924, 272315, 34938, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous photo 8</td>', 'Gorgeous photo 8', '2006-01-02 23:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1996943, 273153, 48546, '<td valign="top">I like the symmetry and how you''ve nicely brought out the detail and pattern in the underside of this bridge.  Good exposure and very nice reflections. Great job!</td>', 'I like the symmetry and how you''ve nicely brought out the detail and pattern in the underside of this bridge.  Good exposure and very nice reflections. Great job!', '2006-01-02 23:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1996952, 272241, 7485, '<td valign="top">Brilliant idea for this challenge! Well executed, only thing I''d preferred is slightly more directional light (for more texture and contrast), and to get rid of those black hairs.</td>', 'Brilliant idea for this challenge! Well executed, only thing I''d preferred is slightly more directional light (for more texture and contrast), and to get rid of those black hairs.', '2006-01-02 23:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1996955, 272750, 48546, '<td valign="top">I really like how you composed this image, good job.</td>', 'I really like how you composed this image, good job.', '2006-01-02 23:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1996964, 272024, 48546, '<td valign="top">Not sure what these are but it''s a nice perspective in your composition.</td>', 'Not sure what these are but it''s a nice perspective in your composition.', '2006-01-02 23:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1997043, 273084, 48546, '<td valign="top">Very interesting image, very good composition. How''d you do it?</td>', 'Very interesting image, very good composition. How''d you do it?', '2006-01-02 23:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1997065, 272251, 48546, '<td valign="top">Not sure what this image is but it doesn''t really matter because the title provides meaning. The light direction adds drama. Very imaginative, great job!</td>', 'Not sure what this image is but it doesn''t really matter because the title provides meaning. The light direction adds drama. Very imaginative, great job!', '2006-01-02 23:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1997094, 272887, 10818, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot...makes me sorta dizzy.  Must be the wine.</td>', 'Excellent shot...makes me sorta dizzy.  Must be the wine.', '2006-01-02 23:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1997100, 273255, 10818, '<td valign="top">I dont think thats a tropical fish, it is however a fantastic shot !</td>', 'I dont think thats a tropical fish, it is however a fantastic shot !', '2006-01-02 23:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1997163, 273244, 3214, '<td valign="top">Man, I could stare at this for hours!</td>', 'Man, I could stare at this for hours!', '2006-01-03 00:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1997169, 271893, 3214, '<td valign="top">Why oh why didn''t you submit this with 640 pixels on the long side?  While I can intuit that there''s a pattern in the leaf veining, I surely can''t see it at this size.</td>', 'Why oh why didn''t you submit this with 640 pixels on the long side?  While I can intuit that there''s a pattern in the leaf veining, I surely can''t see it at this size.', '2006-01-03 00:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1997484, 272526, 49496, '<td valign="top">Sharp eyes and a lot of imagination. I love it!</td>', 'Sharp eyes and a lot of imagination. I love it!', '2006-01-03 02:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1997490, 273215, 7252, '<td valign="top">Good idea but I think it would work better with sharp lines rather than diffused.</td>', 'Good idea but I think it would work better with sharp lines rather than diffused.', '2006-01-03 02:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1997509, 272977, 30364, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  But wait - there''s a twig on the snake''s head - you should have reached over there and just gently plucked it off with your fingers.  Simple, really.  On the other hand, you could be like me and just leave it alone.  On a serious note, I do very much like the fact that you have chosen a natural subject with a pattern, especially as there are two interesting patterns involved (scales and body form - such a clever title, too).  7.</td>', 'Very nice.  But wait - there''s a twig on the snake''s head - you should have reached over there and just gently plucked it off with your fingers.  Simple, really.  On the other hand, you could be like me and just leave it alone.  On a serious note, I do very much like the fact that you have chosen a natural subject with a pattern, especially as there are two interesting patterns involved (scales and body form - such a clever title, too).  7.', '2006-01-03 02:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1997534, 271613, 43434, '<td valign="top">I can''t wait to see how this is done. 9.</td>', 'I can''t wait to see how this is done. 9.', '2006-01-03 03:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1997535, 272824, 43434, '<td valign="top">I like how you have captured this. 8.</td>', 'I like how you have captured this. 8.', '2006-01-03 03:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1997536, 272993, 43434, '<td valign="top">Always wanted to know what to do with bagels. Good concept, nice balance, good bite.</td>', 'Always wanted to know what to do with bagels. Good concept, nice balance, good bite.', '2006-01-03 03:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1997538, 272830, 43434, '<td valign="top">Nice picture. It looks a little oversharpened.7</td>', 'Nice picture. It looks a little oversharpened.7', '2006-01-03 03:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
