(1998013, 272024, 48928, '<td valign="top">I havn''t been able to figure out what these are exactly, but I really like the pattern in portrays.  The colors are awesome too.  the only thing that would have led to me giving you a 10 would have been if the left side was in better focus.  that may have been yopur intention(to have slighlty OOF)  It just would have been more appealing for me , ANYWAYS 9</td>', 'I havn''t been able to figure out what these are exactly, but I really like the pattern in portrays.  The colors are awesome too.  the only thing that would have led to me giving you a 10 would have been if the left side was in better focus.  that may have been yopur intention(to have slighlty OOF)  It just would have been more appealing for me , ANYWAYS 9', '2006-01-03 10:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1998015, 273074, 48928, '<td valign="top">Wow...I like this picture, mainly because it looks really creepy.  that may not have been the intention but to me it just seems like Little Red Riding hood is going to go see grandma.  ALSO I like the dots and the pattern on the dog ( I am assuming??)  9  I had to come back and add this as a favorite.  AND change this to a 10 :)</td>', 'Wow...I like this picture, mainly because it looks really creepy.  that may not have been the intention but to me it just seems like Little Red Riding hood is going to go see grandma.  ALSO I like the dots and the pattern on the dog ( I am assuming??)  9  I had to come back and add this as a favorite.  AND change this to a 10 :)', '2006-01-03 10:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1998100, 273187, 46634, '<td valign="top">Image seems a little dark. I do like the way you captured the ducks reflection in the water.</td>', 'Image seems a little dark. I do like the way you captured the ducks reflection in the water.', '2006-01-03 10:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1998106, 273143, 46634, '<td valign="top">Good shadow capture. Not sure what lighting was used but maybe some WB to get a little more of natural background color. A white background would have made the image "pop" a little more.</td>', 'Good shadow capture. Not sure what lighting was used but maybe some WB to get a little more of natural background color. A white background would have made the image "pop" a little more.', '2006-01-03 10:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1998107, 273129, 46634, '<td valign="top">I love the crispness of this photo. That was what first caught me. The tree is a litte distracting.</td>', 'I love the crispness of this photo. That was what first caught me. The tree is a litte distracting.', '2006-01-03 10:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1998109, 272698, 46634, '<td valign="top">The pattern definitly grabbed me. Unique perspective</td>', 'The pattern definitly grabbed me. Unique perspective', '2006-01-03 10:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1998111, 273140, 46634, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the pattern in the water</td>', 'Nice capture of the pattern in the water', '2006-01-03 10:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1998115, 272652, 46634, '<td valign="top">Interesting....took me a minute to figure out exactly what I was looking at. Still not sure, but I think I like it ;-)</td>', 'Interesting....took me a minute to figure out exactly what I was looking at. Still not sure, but I think I like it ;-)', '2006-01-03 10:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
