(1998133, 272698, 8891, '<td valign="top">Nice tones...I like the steel blue gray. I think you mith have crop down from the top a bit and avoided the blow out in the background and made your pattern stronger at the same time. Very finely composed.</td>', 'Nice tones...I like the steel blue gray. I think you mith have crop down from the top a bit and avoided the blow out in the background and made your pattern stronger at the same time. Very finely composed.', '2006-01-03 10:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
