(1999120, 273151, 8891, '<td valign="top">Simple and very effective.  Great panoply of colors and excellent composition.</td>', 'Simple and very effective.  Great panoply of colors and excellent composition.', '2006-01-03 17:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1999122, 273071, 8891, '<td valign="top">I like this very much....The great wavy lines of the structure running thought the patterns...a very neat piece of architecture for sure. As is usually the case with windows and reflections, you got some inconsitency here. I know happens to me all the time. Great reflections on most and none on a few to the point where you can see in. I hate when that happens. My only suggestion for this is a possible crop of the upper row of windows since they are in a straight line and sort of distract from the bottom three quasi rows where the patterning is most interesting. But so far this is my favorite.</td>', 'I like this very much....The great wavy lines of the structure running thought the patterns...a very neat piece of architecture for sure. As is usually the case with windows and reflections, you got some inconsitency here. I know happens to me all the time. Great reflections on most and none on a few to the point where you can see in. I hate when that happens. My only suggestion for this is a possible crop of the upper row of windows since they are in a straight line and sort of distract from the bottom three quasi rows where the patterning is most interesting. But so far this is my favorite.', '2006-01-03 17:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1999128, 272996, 8891, '<td valign="top">hello....well you found something I really would have love to do for this. I love the concentric circles repeating and receding with all the great diamond shapes of the wires running through them. Sort of like a geodesic cone! My only thought on this would be to have the top either centered or more to the left (or right if you please). It seems sort of random composition wise in this. But don''t lose any sleep over it...I like it very much none-the-less.<br/>Back again...I think just for pure pattern that this one is my favorite. Good luck.</td>', 'hello....well you found something I really would have love to do for this. I love the concentric circles repeating and receding with all the great diamond shapes of the wires running through them. Sort of like a geodesic cone! My only thought on this would be to have the top either centered or more to the left (or right if you please). It seems sort of random composition wise in this. But don''t lose any sleep over it...I like it very much none-the-less.Back again...I think just for pure pattern that this one is my favorite. Good luck.', '2006-01-03 17:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1999186, 273071, 18080, '<td valign="top">Fantastic image.<br/>Hope this does well for you.<br/>A ten from me<br/>Good luck<br/> <br/>Kev</td>', 'Fantastic image.Hope this does well for you.A ten from meGood luck Kev', '2006-01-03 18:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
