(2000328, 272315, 8891, '<td valign="top">This is a very striking image and has caught my eye each time through. The colors of the balloon are great and they stand out nicely against the blue sky and faint cloud patterns. I wish a bit more of the balloon were in the frame...not much more but what ever you could have gotten cause its pattern interests me more. But as it the prolly was not stationary, I''m sure your did what you could. Great composition!  Good Luck!</td>', 'This is a very striking image and has caught my eye each time through. The colors of the balloon are great and they stand out nicely against the blue sky and faint cloud patterns. I wish a bit more of the balloon were in the frame...not much more but what ever you could have gotten cause its pattern interests me more. But as it the prolly was not stationary, I''m sure your did what you could. Great composition!  Good Luck!', '2006-01-03 22:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
