(2000345, 272887, 47487, '<td valign="top">Extremely eye-catching image. Excellent, painstaking composition. Color use is obviously fantastic. (I wish we''d been able to see some kind of refraction of the dots in the glass -- don''t know if that''s even physically possible.)  8</td>', 'Extremely eye-catching image. Excellent, painstaking composition. Color use is obviously fantastic. (I wish we''d been able to see some kind of refraction of the dots in the glass -- don''t know if that''s even physically possible.)  8', '2006-01-03 22:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
