(2000678, 272194, 25892, '<td valign="top">I had been in a movie and on my way out I noticed the carpet so i ran out, grabbed my camera, and came back in. I just started shooting hoping to get out before I could be bothered, however a police officer did politely ask me to take my camera to my car but he was very understanding after I explained</td>', 'I had been in a movie and on my way out I noticed the carpet so i ran out, grabbed my camera, and came back in. I just started shooting hoping to get out before I could be bothered, however a police officer did politely ask me to take my camera to my car but he was very understanding after I explained', '2006-01-04 00:19:34.000000', NULL, 0),
