(2001525, 273196, 47487, '<td valign="top">I was in a hurry entering this -- it was after the site had gone down and I didn''t know how long they''d leave the challenge open to entries -- so I didn''t note how I made the image. It''s simple, really. Filters for the NIkon Coolpix are 77mm and attach to a lens hood which encloses the lens as it zooms in or out. This is a wide-angle image of a handful of marbles arranged on the lens hood with the camera on its back on the tripod, and a light-saber battle (yes really) going on above the camera. Eight-second exposure, and voila.</td>', 'I was in a hurry entering this -- it was after the site had gone down and I didn''t know how long they''d leave the challenge open to entries -- so I didn''t note how I made the image. It''s simple, really. Filters for the NIkon Coolpix are 77mm and attach to a lens hood which encloses the lens as it zooms in or out. This is a wide-angle image of a handful of marbles arranged on the lens hood with the camera on its back on the tripod, and a light-saber battle (yes really) going on above the camera. Eight-second exposure, and voila.', '2006-01-04 02:35:42.000000', NULL, 0),
