(2002366, 271491, 43869, '<td valign="top">Wow, I can''t believe this scored so low!   It''s very creative,  love the reflection of the clouds and definetly fits the challenge.  That low of a score and only 2 comments.  Seems to work that way for me too!<br/> <br/>Don''t beat yourself up- just read your thread lol.  It''s what YOU think of your work that trully matters.</td>', 'Wow, I can''t believe this scored so low!   It''s very creative,  love the reflection of the clouds and definetly fits the challenge.  That low of a score and only 2 comments.  Seems to work that way for me too! Don''t beat yourself up- just read your thread lol.  It''s what YOU think of your work that trully matters.', '2006-01-04 10:19:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(2002372, 273058, 48928, '<td valign="top">I gave you an 8.  i really like the colors, the subject position, and the pattern that was left in the picture.  I think one of the main reasons it may have been scored lower then IMO it deserved was here at DPC if you get too creative  you get knocked for it.  Check over the previous ribbon winners.  You will see MANY photos that are very similar for the top 3 ribbons... People are stuck on what they like.  But great photo, I really like it.</td>', 'I gave you an 8.  i really like the colors, the subject position, and the pattern that was left in the picture.  I think one of the main reasons it may have been scored lower then IMO it deserved was here at DPC if you get too creative  you get knocked for it.  Check over the previous ribbon winners.  You will see MANY photos that are very similar for the top 3 ribbons... People are stuck on what they like.  But great photo, I really like it.', '2006-01-04 10:22:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(2002389, 271491, 40912, '<td valign="top">I gave you a 5 on this one. I liked it, and thought it was neat that it took a second to get the full picture.. I didn''t realize it was a roof right away. I just saw the pattern. The things that took away were the grass in the background and the bricks, both of which are slightly blurred. Maybe if you had cropped those out, it would have scored higher in the Pattern challenge.. I''m not sure. I like the idea, though.. the snow adds interest, it''s just a little too bright. Don''t be discouraged! Have fun. :)</td>', 'I gave you a 5 on this one. I liked it, and thought it was neat that it took a second to get the full picture.. I didn''t realize it was a roof right away. I just saw the pattern. The things that took away were the grass in the background and the bricks, both of which are slightly blurred. Maybe if you had cropped those out, it would have scored higher in the Pattern challenge.. I''m not sure. I like the idea, though.. the snow adds interest, it''s just a little too bright. Don''t be discouraged! Have fun. :)', '2006-01-04 10:27:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(2002444, 273058, 31443, '<td valign="top">For what it''s worth; People tend to punish those who make a mistake in spelling..spining instead of spinning could hav put people off the photo. I scored this rather low because I  thought a pattern was not the really displayed but a spinning light and I wasn''t sure what to think of the focus or lack thereof. I did like the colors though. Remember also that people only give themselves a few seconds to score each image and any little flaw will make people go for the lower numbers....looking at the voting breakdown, you will see it''s a very typical curve and 5+ is an average score, not bad..</td>', 'For what it''s worth; People tend to punish those who make a mistake in spelling..spining instead of spinning could hav put people off the photo. I scored this rather low because I  thought a pattern was not the really displayed but a spinning light and I wasn''t sure what to think of the focus or lack thereof. I did like the colors though. Remember also that people only give themselves a few seconds to score each image and any little flaw will make people go for the lower numbers....looking at the voting breakdown, you will see it''s a very typical curve and 5+ is an average score, not bad..', '2006-01-04 10:40:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(2002477, 273142, 2563, '<td valign="top">Congratulations!!! I was just reading yesterday about you and your wife and the picture of your baby on the site...Great family indeed, your wish to get a blue ribbon came true, while having a score above 7 was already true from the last challenge, ribbon or not...Congratulations and thank you for sharing your photos!</td>', 'Congratulations!!! I was just reading yesterday about you and your wife and the picture of your baby on the site...Great family indeed, your wish to get a blue ribbon came true, while having a score above 7 was already true from the last challenge, ribbon or not...Congratulations and thank you for sharing your photos!', '2006-01-04 10:48:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(2002482, 273058, 48298, '<td valign="top">I admit...my eight-year-old daughter and I caught the spelling mistake.  We were wondering if it was a special kind of light CALLED a "spining" light?  LOL  I scored it on the low side, too...also because it didn''t seem to have sharp focus, and I prefer more natural images over "abstract"-type photos.  Just personal preference, polkop...and spelling mistakes bug me a bit.  I see you spelled it right in your comments. ;)</td>', 'I admit...my eight-year-old daughter and I caught the spelling mistake.  We were wondering if it was a special kind of light CALLED a "spining" light?  LOL  I scored it on the low side, too...also because it didn''t seem to have sharp focus, and I prefer more natural images over "abstract"-type photos.  Just personal preference, polkop...and spelling mistakes bug me a bit.  I see you spelled it right in your comments. ;)', '2006-01-04 10:49:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(2002548, 273003, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ok - Three flower shots in a row.  All well done I might add.  ;^)  This one surprised me as a choice for ''Pattern''.  It''s hard to get past the whole item and see the pattern.  The brain automatically says "flower" rather than "oooh...cool pattern".  I get the connection, but I''m thinking not many voters slowed down enough to give this shot due consideration.<br/> <br/>As for the image itself, I really like the choice of composition and the exposure is right on setting up a nice tonal range.  For some reason my eyes keep coming back to that one curled up petal positioned lower center...not a bad thing, just an observation.<br/> <br/>Anyway - I was just catching up on some of the members I have marked as favorites and was passing thru your area.<br/> <br/>Smile and keep having fun!  ;^)</td>', 'Ok - Three flower shots in a row.  All well done I might add.  ;^)  This one surprised me as a choice for ''Pattern''.  It''s hard to get past the whole item and see the pattern.  The brain automatically says "flower" rather than "oooh...cool pattern".  I get the connection, but I''m thinking not many voters slowed down enough to give this shot due consideration. As for the image itself, I really like the choice of composition and the exposure is right on setting up a nice tonal range.  For some reason my eyes keep coming back to that one curled up petal positioned lower center...not a bad thing, just an observation. Anyway - I was just catching up on some of the members I have marked as favorites and was passing thru your area. Smile and keep having fun!  ;^)', '2006-01-04 11:08:20.000000', NULL, 0),
