(2004851, 273214, 48467, '<td valign="top">Because this picture appears to be something I''d expect to see in a generic stock photography catalog, conveys no emotion, and is fairly bland, I''m tempted to give you a 10. However, your valiant attempt at creating high-quality stock photography contains BLOWN HIGHLIGHTS which offends me so I am leaning towards giving you a 1. But then it doesn''t really matter, as voting has ended.</td>', 'Because this picture appears to be something I''d expect to see in a generic stock photography catalog, conveys no emotion, and is fairly bland, I''m tempted to give you a 10. However, your valiant attempt at creating high-quality stock photography contains BLOWN HIGHLIGHTS which offends me so I am leaning towards giving you a 1. But then it doesn''t really matter, as voting has ended.', '2006-01-04 21:18:17.000000', NULL, 0),
