(2228237, 272782, 34659, '<td valign="top">Have to agree with some of the other comments - the focus really hurt you on this shot.  I think that if it had been tack sharp, a lot of other things would have fallen into place.  Could probably use a bit more tonal range too (adjusting the contrast and perhaps burning/dodging a bit).  Not your strongest shot.</td>', 'Have to agree with some of the other comments - the focus really hurt you on this shot.  I think that if it had been tack sharp, a lot of other things would have fallen into place.  Could probably use a bit more tonal range too (adjusting the contrast and perhaps burning/dodging a bit).  Not your strongest shot.', '2006-03-14 22:01:03.000000', NULL, 0),
